    { 3106, "ct", "How many carats did the Cullinan, the largest gem diamond ever found, weigh?", "3,106 carats (621 g), found in South Africa in 1905; its pieces are in the British Crown Jewels.", "Combien de carats pesait le Cullinan, le plus gros diamant jamais trouvé ?", "3 106 carats (621 g), trouvé en Afrique du Sud en 1905 ; ses morceaux ornent les joyaux de la Couronne britannique.", "src: Cullinan Diamond; web-checked" },
