    { 1832, "year", "Jonathan, a giant tortoise on Saint Helena, is the oldest known land animal. Around which year (at the latest) did he hatch?", "Around 1832: he was already fully grown when he arrived on the island in 1882.", "Jonathan, tortue géante de Sainte-Hélène, est le plus vieil animal terrestre connu. Vers quelle année (au plus tard) est-il né ?", "Vers 1832 : il était déjà adulte en arrivant sur l'île en 1882.", "src: Jonathan (tortoise) (Guinness)" },
